{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c7db","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b07e-1184-7ee2-a636-22f940ee305b"},"sequence":584,"recorded_at":1780531400001163,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"8a76739b-7cd3-4623-8bf5-9ad19ff6cfdd","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"8a76739b-7cd3-4623-8bf5-9ad19ff6cfdd","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"8a76739b-7cd3-4623-8bf5-9ad19ff6cfdd"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0b080-31a1-7030-819d-10c32c5c927f"},"task_id":"01a0b080-31a1-7030-819d-10c32c5c927f","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0b080-31a1-7030-819d-10c32c5c927f","chunk":"Read text file `.temp/resources/TASK-260830-24z2b3/TASK-260830-24z2b3_results.md`.\n1|# TASK-260830-24z2b3 Results — implement-clone-bundle-and-canonical-session-types\n2|\n3|Status: ready for review. Candidate left UNCOMMITTED in the Story\n4|worktree (`task-board/story/STORY-260830-1cyj0q`); no commit on the\n5|Story branch.\n6|\n7|## Delivered\n8|\n9|`internal/clonebundle` (new package, 11 production files) implements\n10|the Section 13.14.1 clone capture contracts over the landed owners:\n11|\n12|- Clone Raw Object Manifest 1.0.0 (`rawmanifest.go`): closed\n13|  envelope, omit-self ID, sorted unique entries, total_bytes sum,\n14|  raw class subset, descriptor agreement at construction.\n15|- Clone Capture Manifest 1.0.0 (`capturebuild.go`, `captureitem.go`,\n16|  `boundary.go`): Source Basis union, Capture Boundary union with\n17|  stable-proof coupling, sorted Capture Items, exact excluded\n18|  classes, core-derived `raw_complete`, maximal_safe and G2 gates.\n19|- Canonical Session 1.0.0 + Actors (`session.go`): one main actor,\n20|  ordered unique event IDs, head subset.\n21|- Canonical Event 1.0.0 (`event.go`): 26-kind vocabulary,\n22|  visibility, kind-selected payload with content-block rules,\n23|  SourceEvidence with synthesized coupling, sorted unique raw refs,\n24|  ordinal contiguity.\n25|- Identities (`identity.go`): NativeIdentity, WorkspaceBinding,\n26|  shared native-key sanitizer (no absolute path, UUIDv7/AX\n27|  confusion, embedded credentials, AX markers, control chars).\n28|- Immutable generations (`generation.go`): opaque tokens with exact\n29|  equality, digest-equality comparison.\n30|- Raw evidence descriptors (`blobref.go`): Blob Descriptor shape +\n31|  identity via `canonicaljson.CalculateObjectIdentity` with a local\n32|  claim comparison (never the attesting entry, per the provhost\n33|  no-attestation bound), blob/size agreement, install through\n34|  `localstore.PutBlob`.\n35|\n36|Also: `TRACEABILITY.md` (clause map), `testdata/mutant_harness.py`\n37|(17 narrowing + 1 control), README package section (test commands,\n38|no capability claim), LOGBOOK entry (newest-first).\n39|\n40|## AC coverage: 18 of 18 rows driven\n41|\n42|See `TASK-260830-24z2b3_conformance-matrix.md`: every row names its\n43|production call site and driving test. No prose-only claims.\n44|\n45|## Validation (final tree)\n46|\n47|- `gofmt` / `go build` / `go vet`: PASS (log `validate-01-03.log`)\n48|- `go test ./... -count=1`: PASS, 38/38 packages ok (log `validate-04-test.log`)\n49|- `go test ./... -race -count=1`: 37/38 at the default 10m timeout; the\n50|  one red package is `internal/sessquery`, which exceeds 600s under\n51|  race on this host with no DATA RACE and no failing assertion\n52|  (log `validate-05-race.log`). Reran isolated: same 600s timeout\n53|  (log `validate-05b-sessquery-race.log`); with `-timeout 25m` it\n54|  passes in 630s (log `validate-05c-sessquery-race-25m.log`).\n55|  `sessquery` is untouched by this change (nothing outside\n56|  `internal/clonebundle` imports it) — pure host slowness, reported\n57|  as a finding, not a pass-by-rerun: the default-timeout race gate\n58|  stays red on `sessquery` on this machine.\n59|- `go test ./... -cover -count=1`: PASS, 38 packages, clonebundle 82.2% (log `validate-06-cover.log`)\n60|- Fuzz smoke 14/14 targets: PASS (log `validate-07-20-fuzz.log`)\n61|- `tracecheck`: PASS; `cataloggen -adopted -check`: PASS\n62|- `GOOS=linux` / `GOOS=windows` builds: PASS\n63|- JSON validation, `task-board validate`, `git diff --check`: PASS\n64|- Mutant harness: 17 KILLED + 1 SURVIVED control, exit 0 (log `mutants.log`)\n65|\n66|## Notable finding\n67|\n68|The first full-suite run reddened\n69|`provhost.TestNoProductionPathAttestsProviderIdentityBinding`: that\n70|census forbids any non-test call to\n71|`canonicaljson.VerifyObjectIdentity` outside `internal/sessrepo`.\n72|Fixed at the root cause following the landed `sessprofile` precedent:\n73|`blobref.go` now uses `CalculateObjectIdentity` (shape + digest)\n74|with a local claim comparison and never calls the attesting entry.\n75|A wrong-claim negative plus narrowing mutant `N-descriptor-claim`\n76|pin the new gate. No test was weakened; `provhost` and the full\n77|suite are green.\n78|\n79|## Bounds for siblings (not waived)\n80|\n81|- Per-kind event payload fact registries past the envelope\n82|  (`checkPayload`); maximal_safe planning past the refusal gate;\n83|  G2 admission past `RefuseUnstableForTarget`; Section 7.8\n84|  operation wiring (stays `sessadapter`); `internal/traceability`\n85|  bindings + re-pin (FINAL leaf).\n86|\n87|## Attachments\n88|\n89|- `TASK-260830-24z2b3_conformance-matrix.md`\n90|- `TASK-260830-24z2b3_producer-evidence.tar.gz` (validation logs,\n91|  mutant log, package test log, file manifest)","final_result":true}}}
