{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c7df","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b07e-1184-7ee2-a636-22f940ee305b"},"sequence":586,"recorded_at":1780531400001167,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"8a76739b-7cd3-4623-8bf5-9ad19ff6cfdd","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"8a76739b-7cd3-4623-8bf5-9ad19ff6cfdd","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"8a76739b-7cd3-4623-8bf5-9ad19ff6cfdd"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0b080-31e9-7fb1-aff9-2e2cd91d2fb0"},"task_id":"01a0b080-31e9-7fb1-aff9-2e2cd91d2fb0","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0b080-31e9-7fb1-aff9-2e2cd91d2fb0","chunk":"Read text file `.temp/resources/TASK-260830-24z2b3/TASK-260830-24z2b3_conformance-matrix.md`.\n1|# TASK-260830-24z2b3 Conformance Matrix\n2|\n3|Authority: `internal/specdoc/SPEC.v0.6.0.md`, Sections 7.8, 10.2, 13.14.1.\n4|Package: `internal/clonebundle`. Normative spec text is quoted from the\n5|pinned file; the prose here maps, never restates.\n6|\n7|## AC coverage: 18 of 18 rows driven\n8|\n9|Every row is driven through the named production entry point by the\n10|named committed test. Prose ratio: **18 of 18 AC rows driven**.\n11|\n12|| # | AC row | Production call site | Named test |\n13||---|---|---|---|\n14|| 1 | Raw Object Manifest closed envelope + omit-self ID | `BuildRawObjectManifest`, `DecodeRawObjectManifest` | `TestBuildRawManifestRoundTrip`, `TestRawManifestRefusals/decode` |\n15|| 2 | RawObjectEntry class subset (credential/auth/runtime/lock forbidden) | `buildRawEntries`, `decodeRawEntries`, `validRawEntryClass` | `TestRawManifestRefusals/build` (unknown + 4 forbidden-class rows) |\n16|| 3 | Sorted unique entries, total_bytes = sum | `buildRawEntries`, `decodeRawEntries` | `TestRawManifestRefusals` (unsorted, duplicate, total mismatch) |\n17|| 4 | Sanitized native keys, never an AX Session ID | `SanitizeNativeKey` | `TestIdentityRefusals/sanitizer` + key rows in raw/capture/session/event tables |\n18|| 5 | Row-21 exclusion allowlist at construction | `refuseExcludedMember` | `TestRawManifestExcludesTrustMaterial`, `TestCaptureManifestExcludesTrustMaterial` |\n19|| 6 | Capture Manifest envelope + omit-self ID | `BuildCaptureManifest`, `DecodeCaptureManifest` | `TestBuildCaptureManifestDerivesRawComplete`, `TestCaptureManifestRefusals/decode` |\n20|| 7 | CaptureItem 9-class vocabulary + included/excluded content rule | `ValidCaptureClass`, `checkItemDisposition` | `TestCaptureClassVocabularyIsPinned`, `TestCaptureItemRefusals` |\n21|| 8 | Always-excluded classes never included | `alwaysExcludedClass` | `TestCaptureItemRefusals` (credential, machine_auth, runtime_state, transient_lock rows) |\n22|| 9 | excluded_classes exactly the excluded-row classes | `excludedRowClasses`, `excludedClassesExact` | `TestExcludedClassesExactGate`, `TestCaptureManifestRefusals/decode` (extra, missing, unsorted, unknown) |\n23|| 10 | Core-derived raw_complete + plan/object reconciliation | `deriveRawComplete`, `VerifyCaptureReconciliation` | `TestBuildCaptureManifestDerivesRawComplete`, `TestBuildCaptureManifestUnknownMakesIncomplete`, `TestCaptureManifestRefusals/reconciliation` |\n24|| 11 | Unknown blocks maximal_safe | `RefuseMaximalSafeUnlessComplete` | `TestBuildCaptureManifestUnknownMakesIncomplete`, `TestCaptureManifestRefusals/reconciliation` |\n25|| 12 | Capture Source Basis closed union | `DecodeSourceBasis`, `buildSourceBasis` | `TestSourceBasisRefusals` |\n26|| 13 | Capture Boundary union + stable-proof coupling | `DecodeCaptureBoundary`, `buildBoundary`, `checkProofCoupling` | `TestBoundaryRefusals`, `TestBuildCaptureManifestUnstableArchive` |\n27|| 14 | Unstable is core-created; G2 rejects it | `buildBoundary` (Core), `RefuseUnstableForTarget` | `TestBoundaryRefusals/build_core-only_unstable`, `TestBuildCaptureManifestUnstableArchive` |\n28|| 15 | NativeIdentity + WorkspaceBinding identities | `DecodeNativeIdentity`, `EncodeNativeIdentity`, `IdentityDigest`, `DecodeWorkspaceBinding` | `TestNativeIdentityRoundTrip`, `TestIdentityDigestIsStable`, `TestIdentityRefusals` |\n29|| 16 | Canonical Session + Actor rules (one main, event/head IDs) | `BuildCanonicalSession`, `DecodeCanonicalSession` | `TestBuildCanonicalSessionRoundTrip`, `TestCanonicalSessionRefusals` |\n30|| 17 | Canonical Event + SourceEvidence + raw refs + ordinals + generations | `BuildCanonicalEvent`, `DecodeCanonicalEvent`, `DecodeSourceEvidence`, `checkPayload`, `CheckOrdinalContiguity`, `ParseGeneration` | `TestEventKindVocabularyIsPinned`, `TestBuildCanonicalEventRoundTrip`, `TestCanonicalEventRefusals`, `TestOrdinalContiguity`, `TestGenerationRefusals` |\n31|| 18 | Blob Descriptor identity + byte-count agreement + no-replace install | `VerifyDescriptorAgreement`, `InstallRawBlob`, `VerifyRawManifestDescriptors` | `TestBlobAgreementRefusals`, `TestInstallRawBlobIsIdempotent`, `TestBuildRawManifestRoundTrip` |\n32|\n33|## Negative/refusal evidence\n34|\n35|Every refusal above fails when the gate admits what it must reject:\n36|the 17 narrowing mutants in `internal/clonebundle/testdata/mutant_harness.py`\n37|weaken each gate to admit exactly one forbidden member and the named\n38|killer fails (17 KILLED, 1 harmless SURVIVED control). Per-plant\n39|results are in the producer evidence tar.\n40|\n41|## Landed-owner reuse (not new behavior, cited not counted)\n42|\n43|| Scope | Owner | Evidence |\n44||---|---|---|\n45|| Section 7.8 operation frames (capture-plan/capture/normalize fresh isolated sinks; probe/manifest/discover/inspect read-only) | `internal/sessadapter` (`CheckRequestBody`, `CheckSuccessBody`, `CheckFreshSink`) | landed sessadapter suite, green in this run |\n46|| Section 10.2 crash/idempotency discipline (fsync, atomic no-replace, quarantine) | `internal/localstore` | landed localstore fault suites, green in this run; delegation proven by `TestInstallRawBlobIsIdempotent` |\n47|| Closed-shape registry rows for these schemas | `internal/canonicaljson` (`rejectUnsupportedImmutableObjectShape`, census-pinned) | intentionally not replaced; this package is the validating owner (see `doc.go`) |\n48|\n49|## Stated bounds (sibling scope, not waived)\n50|\n51|- Per-kind Canonical Event payload fact registries beyond the\n52|  Section 13.14.1 envelope in `checkPayload` (normalization sibling).\n53|- `maximal_safe` projection planning past\n54|  `RefuseMaximalSafeUnlessComplete` (projection sibling).\n55|- Target-branch (G2) admission past `RefuseUnstableForTarget`.\n56|- Section 7.8 capture-plan/capture/normalize operation wiring\n57|  (stays `sessadapter`-owned).\n58|- `internal/traceability` registry bindings and digest re-pin\n59|  (Story FINAL leaf).","final_result":true}}}
